# A narrowed value can cross every array storage boundary

Verifies a null check permits a nullable value to initialize, assign, push,
and unshift a non-nullable array while the proof is in scope.

>>> source
let item: int? = 10
if (item != null) {
    let values: int[] = [item]
    values[0] = item
    values->push(item)
    values->unshift(item)
    print(values)
}

<<< stdout
[10, 10, 10]

<<< stderr
